# Build output of the six interop drivers. Every language builds in place,
# beside its source, and the working tree is measured rather than a published
# version, so the artefacts land inside the repository.
#
# There are roughly 530,000 lines of them. They are output, not source: the
# runner rebuilds all six on every run unless told not to.

# Go: `go build -o interop .`
/go/interop

# Rust: `cargo build`
/rust/target/

# Swift: `swift build`. The root .gitignore already excludes `.build/`
# anywhere; this entry states the intent locally rather than depending on it.
/swift/.build/

# Kotlin: `gradlew installDist`, plus Gradle's own caches and daemon state.
/kotlin/build/
/kotlin/.gradle/
/kotlin/.kotlin/
